                <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:10px;">
                  <h3 class="chart-title" style="margin-bottom:0; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:12px; color:#ffffff;">EvoluciÃ³n de Ventas Anual</h3>
